mission "A Scholar Without a Flag"
    name "A Scholar Without a Flag"
    description "Meet Doctor Inez Salvatierra and learn why she is buying every chart of the western shoals."
    source "Bellweather Cay"
    destination "Port de Lune"
    reward 875
    speaker offer "Doctor Inez Salvatierra"
    speaker visit "Doctor Inez Salvatierra"
    speaker complete "Doctor Inez Salvatierra"
    to offer
        has "The Monk Who Burned His Maps: done"
    on offer
        conversation
            `Meet Doctor Inez Salvatierra and learn why she is buying every chart of the western shoals.`
            `Doctor Inez Salvatierra studies you for a moment. "The old sea charter settled one war, but it did not settle the past. The lost expedition sailed west under a sealed order, and its wake is stirring every ambitious captain in these waters."
            choice
                `(I will help uncover what happened.)`
                    accept
                `(Tell me what you are not saying.)`
                    goto details
                `(I have no wish to be drawn into another quarrel.)`
                    close
            label details
                `Doctor Inez Salvatierra lowers their voice. "The maps were altered, the convoy erased from the books, and someone has been buying witnesses. Follow the evidence, not the flags."`
                choice
                    `(Then I will take the matter in hand.)`
                        accept
                    `(Not today.)`
                        close
    on accept
        log "Accepted A Scholar Without a Flag. Meet Doctor Inez Salvatierra and learn why she is buying every chart of the western shoals."
    on visit
        conversation
            `Doctor Inez Salvatierra receives you at Port de Lune. The evidence fits another piece into the puzzle: the expedition was not searching for gold alone, but for a place deliberately removed from every official chart.`
    on complete
        conversation
            `Doctor Inez Salvatierra thanks you. "Every answer makes the sea less simple, captain. Yet the truth belongs to the people who live here, not to the first crown or company that can put a seal upon it."`
        log "Completed A Scholar Without a Flag. Received 875 gold. Meet Doctor Inez Salvatierra and learn why she is buying every chart of the western shoals."
